T*
/F1 10 Tf
13 TL
(This project addresses physical presentation attacks \(print, replay, video\) only.) Tj
T*
(Digital attacks such as deepfake injection are a distinct category and are explicitly) Tj
T*
(out of scope.) Tj
ET
