(A threshold sweep shows raising the deployed liveness threshold to 0.95-0.96 is a free) Tj
T*
(improvement in this sample \(genuine users unaffected\), but no threshold fully closes) Tj
T*
(the laptop-replay gap without a real cost to genuine acceptance. This report does not) Tj
T*
(change the deployed threshold -- that decision is left to the project owner with this) Tj
T*
(evidence in hand.) Tj
ET
