(5. Limitations and Scope Decisions - Stated Plainly) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf
13 TL
(Physiological liveness \(rPPG\) - deferred. Built and calibrated offline but not wired) Tj
T*
(into the live pipeline; it needs a stable 10-15 second capture window that does not fit) Tj
T*
(the current per-tick UI model.) Tj
T*
T*
(Active liveness covers 2 challenge types \(blink, head-turn\). A direct test confirmed a) Tj
T*
(replayed video of a real blink is accepted -- landmark-based active liveness cannot) Tj
T*
(distinguish a live blink from a recorded one, exactly why the system does not rely on) Tj
T*
(it alone.) Tj
ET
