(Occlusion detection is a visibility-based approximation, not a trained classifier. It) Tj
T*
(can flag likely obstruction but not identify what is causing it.) Tj
T*
T*
(Demographic bias - confirmed, unmitigated. Measured across 80 real images: quality) Tj
T*
(pass rate 20.0% \(female\) vs. 42.5% \(male\); liveness pass rate 25.0% \(senior\) vs.) Tj
T*
(46.2% \(middle-aged\); a smaller but present skin-tone gap. No mitigation attempted.) Tj
T*
T*
(Multi-angle enrollment simplified to front-only. The original three-angle flow was) Tj
T*
(unreliable in practice, and duplicate-detection and verification already relied on the) Tj
T*
(front template almost exclusively for accuracy.) Tj
T*
T*
(A known, intermittent WebRTC connection hiccup exists -- the camera connection can) Tj
T*
(silently drop for 20-30 seconds and self-recover. Root-caused as far as the evidence) Tj
T*
(allows to a library-level characteristic, not an application bug.) Tj
T*
T*
/F2 14 Tf
18 TL
