T*
/F1 10 Tf
13 TL
(Language: Python 3.11. Computer Vision: OpenCV. Face Detection and Landmarks:) Tj
T*
(MediaPipe Face Mesh, 468-point landmarks. Face Recognition and Matching: DeepFace) Tj
T*
(with the ArcFace backend, pretrained, no retraining. Passive Liveness: DeepFace) Tj
T*
(anti-spoofing \(MiniFASNet\). Active Liveness: custom MediaPipe + EAR + solvePnP.) Tj
T*
(Backend API: FastAPI \(/register, /verify\). Database: SQLite, local, no cloud) Tj
T*
(dependency. User Interface: Streamlit + streamlit-webrtc, chosen over React since the) Tj
T*
(brief marks the UI as optional.) Tj
ET
